---
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
// Briola, Bartolucci & Aste (Quantitative Finance 25(7), 2025), section 7.1: average Matthews correlation
// coefficient of a DeepLOB-type model, no threshold, 15 NASDAQ stocks, by tick-size group and horizon
// (H = number of order book updates ahead). 0 = random, 1 = perfect.
const W = 900, H = 412, X0 = 90, BASE = 330, SC = 600;
const hs = ['H10', 'H50', 'H100'];
const groups = [
  { k: 'large', en: 'large tick', vi: 'bước giá lớn', cls: 'f-bid', v: [0.29, 0.36, 0.26] },
  { k: 'mid', en: 'medium tick', vi: 'bước giá vừa', cls: 'f-empty-solid', v: [0.13, 0.085, 0.036] },
  { k: 'small', en: 'small tick', vi: 'bước giá nhỏ', cls: 'f-ask', v: [0.11, 0.04, 0.01] },
];
---
<figure class="f">
  <div class="f-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Average Matthews correlation coefficient of a deep learning order book model on 15 NASDAQ stocks. Large-tick stocks: 0.29 at 10 updates ahead, 0.36 at 50 and 0.26 at 100. Medium-tick stocks: 0.13, 0.085 and 0.036. Small-tick stocks: 0.11, 0.04 and 0.01. Zero means random.">
    <DiagramIcon name="model" x={24} y={20} size={22} />
    <text x="46" y="26" class="f-h"><tspan data-lang-en>A deep order book model, stock group by stock group</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Một mô hình học sâu trên sổ lệnh, theo từng nhóm cổ phiếu</tspan></text>
    <line x1={X0} x2="860" y1={BASE} y2={BASE} class="f-axis" />
    {[0.1, 0.2, 0.3].map((t) => (
      <g>
        <line x1={X0} x2="860" y1={BASE - t * SC} y2={BASE - t * SC} class="f-grid" />
        <text x={X0 - 10} y={BASE - t * SC + 4} text-anchor="end" class="f-sub"><tspan data-lang-en>{t.toFixed(1)}</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>{t.toFixed(1).replace('.', ',')}</tspan></text>
      </g>
    ))}
    <text x={X0 - 10} y={BASE + 4} text-anchor="end" class="f-sub">0</text>
    {hs.map((h, hi) => (
      <g>
        <text x={X0 + 130 + hi * 240} y={BASE + 28} text-anchor="middle" class="f-qty"><tspan data-lang-en>{h}: {h.slice(1)} updates ahead</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>{h}: sau {h.slice(1)} cập nhật</tspan></text>
        {groups.map((g, gi) => (
          <g>
            <rect x={X0 + 40 + hi * 240 + gi * 62} y={BASE - g.v[hi] * SC} width="52" height={g.v[hi] * SC} rx="3" class={g.cls} />
            <text x={X0 + 66 + hi * 240 + gi * 62} y={BASE - g.v[hi] * SC - 6} text-anchor="middle" class="f-sub"><tspan data-lang-en>{String(g.v[hi])}</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>{String(g.v[hi]).replace('.', ',')}</tspan></text>
          </g>
        ))}
      </g>
    ))}
    {groups.map((g, gi) => (
      <g>
        <rect x={X0 + 10 + gi * 190} y="50" width="16" height="16" rx="3" class={g.cls} />
        <text x={X0 + 34 + gi * 190} y="63" class="f-qty"><tspan data-lang-en>{g.en}</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>{g.vi}</tspan></text>
      </g>
    ))}
    <text x="40" y="394" class="f-sub"><tspan data-lang-en>MCC: 0 is random guessing, 1 is perfect. Three classes: down, stable, up. 15 NASDAQ stocks, 2017 to 2019.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>MCC: 0 là đoán bừa, 1 là hoàn hảo. Ba lớp: giảm, đứng yên, tăng. 15 cổ phiếu NASDAQ, 2017 đến 2019.</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>The same model predicts far better on large-tick stocks and falls to coin-flip level on small-tick stocks at the longest horizon. A forecast score is not yet a trading result.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Cùng một mô hình đoán tốt hơn hẳn ở cổ phiếu bước giá lớn và rơi xuống mức tung đồng xu ở cổ phiếu bước giá nhỏ khi nhìn xa nhất. Điểm dự báo chưa phải kết quả giao dịch.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .f { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .f-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .f svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .f text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .f .f-h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .f .f-sub { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .f .f-price { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; fill: var(--text); }
  .f .f-qty { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; fill: var(--text); }
  .f .f-faint { font-size: 12px; fill: var(--text-muted); font-style: italic; }
  .f .f-ann { font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 600; fill: var(--text); }
  .f .f-ann.is-ask, .f .f-ann.is-red { fill: var(--red); }
  .f .f-ann.is-bid, .f .f-ann.is-green { fill: var(--act-2); }
  .f .f-ann.is-gold { fill: var(--gold-icon); }
  .f .f-mid-t { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .f-ask { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.3; }
  .f-bid { fill: color-mix(in srgb, var(--act-2) 16%, var(--bg)); stroke: var(--act-2); stroke-width: 1.3; }
  .f-empty { fill: none; stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; stroke-dasharray: 4 4; }
  .f-gone { fill: none; stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.3; stroke-dasharray: 4 4; }
  .f-mid { stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 1.8; stroke-dasharray: 6 4; }
  .f-lead { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; fill: none; }
  .f-panel { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .f-card { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .f-arrow { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.3; }
  .f-axis { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .f-grid { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; stroke-dasharray: 3 4; }
  .f figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
  .f-empty-solid { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 1.3; }
</style>
